<title>USA: Pakistan buys 225,000 T US soft white wheat-trade.</title>
<headline>Pakistan buys 225,000 T US soft white wheat-trade.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan bought 225,000 tonnes U.S. soft white wheat over the weekend in an approximate range of $169.60 to $171.22 a tonne, FOB, U.S. exporters said.</p>
<p>Shipment was slated for October 10-31, they said.</p>
<p>--Doris Frankel 312-983-7305</p>
</text>
